#   upstream, and because L2 is where the number gets read.
# - Relative to 1.8.0: no change to authentication (section 2), FlowHeader
#   (section 4), Target (section 5), SetupResult, UoT, MuxHeader or the QUIC
#   DATAGRAM header. The 59-vector fixture carries across unchanged.
# - Relative to 1.7: adds the TLS Mux carrier; removes the pool parameter
